  "description": "The single source of truth for Migo's cross-platform design language, restyled to the flat mig33-lineage reference: a teal-and-orange messenger with a deep-teal tab strip over a flat-orange me card, IRC-style script transcripts, flush hairline list rows and a pale status band. Solid colours only — no gradients, no glossy highlights, no bevels, no text shadows; separation comes from 1px borders and one soft elevation shadow. Web reads these as CSS custom properties (clients/web/src/app/globals.css), Android maps them into Theme.kt, and the desktop client maps them into theme.rs. One product, one identity, every screen size.",
